{
  "_about": "30-address test set, prepared 2026-10-27. Street-level pins, no private residences. `expect` is the oracle in ranges; the scorer fails on wrong buckets, statuses or attributions, not on a count off by one. `oracle_confidence` marks rows where the oracle itself is thin: re-verify those against the facility database before calling a mismatch a product bug.",
